            "review_title": "Review at BẾP PHỐ - BÚN ĐẬU, BÚN RIÊU VỊ BẮC",
            "review_text": "Lan Anh L\n5 contributions\n0\nGreat !!!\nJul 2026 • Couples\nWe found this restaurant by chance and it became one of our favorite meals in Ho Chi Minh City. The restaurant is beautifully designed with a peaceful atmosphere, especially the balcony overlooking the street. We tried the Bún Riêu and Bún Đậu Mắm Tôm, and both were delicious and full of authentic Northern Vietnamese flavors. The staff were friendly, attentive, and happy to explain the dishes. Highly recommended if you want to experience local cuisine in a clean and comfortable setting.\nRead more\nWritten July 29, 2026",
